Subject: [PATCH] MAINTAINERS: cover the Airoha EN7581 SOE binding

Add the EN7581 Secure Offload Engine binding to the existing Airoha
Ethernet driver entry.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6
Signed-off-by: Jihong Min <hurryman2212@gmail.com>

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index 1ac86d8..ecd9960 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -744,6 +744,7 @@ L:	linux-mediatek@lists.infradead.org (moderated for non-subscribers)
 L:	netdev@vger.kernel.org
 S:	Maintained
 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/airoha,en7581-eth.yaml
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/airoha,en7581-soe.yaml
 F:	drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/
 
 AIROHA PCIE PHY DRIVER
